          "start": 554.894,
          "end": 555.281,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "not",
          "start": 555.281,
          "end": 555.669,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "chores.",
          "start": 555.669,
          "end": 556.056,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They're not duties or obligations. The Quran teaches that they are gifts from God.",
