          "end": 1223.983,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "do?",
          "start": 1223.983,
          "end": 1224.298,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "I",
          "start": 1224.298,
          "end": 1224.613,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "have",
          "start": 1224.613,
          "end": 1224.928,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "arthritis.\"",
          "start": 1224.928,
          "end": 1225.243,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And they said \"every few hours you must get out and stretch.\"",
