          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "\"I believe that Muhammad, Jesus, Mary, Hussein, Ali, none of them has any power.\"",
      "start": 1519.671,
      "end": 1524.243,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
