          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "Frequently.",
          "start": 1568.921,
          "end": 1569.588,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And this is not any ritual or anything that you perform. It's something that you do continuously.",
