    },
    {
      "text": "So, you're thinking of God. What is the Afternoon Prayer? You're doing it, you're not doing it to get a salary, or to be paid.",
      "start": 2028.909,
      "end": 2036.064,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
