          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "saved.",
          "start": 2124.897,
          "end": 2125.308,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The ego, NAFS (\u0646\u0641\u0633).",
      "start": 2127.308,
      "end": 2129.308,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "The",
          "start": 2127.308,
          "end": 2127.808,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "ego,",
          "start": 2127.808,
          "end": 2128.308,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "NAFS",
          "start": 2128.308,
          "end": 2128.808,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "(\u0646\u0641\u0633).",
          "start": 2128.808,
          "end": 2129.308,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, in order, the Five Prayers, and this ZIKR (\u0630\u06a9\u0631) will help you, as to who your god is.",
