          "end": 2477.724,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "Shahadah.",
          "start": 2477.724,
          "end": 2478.101,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, when we grew up, they told us \"the Shahadah is \"Ash-hadu Alla Elaha Ella Allah Wa Ash-hadu Anna Muhammadan Rasulallah.\"",
