          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They will fall under Aqrabin (\u0623\u064e\u0642\u0652\u0631\u064e\u0628\u0650\u064a\u0646\u064e), the relatives.",
