          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "a",
          "start": 3566.235,
          "end": 3566.584,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "messenger...",
          "start": 3566.584,
          "end": 3566.933,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, every Nabi (\u0646\u0628\u06cc) was a messenger but not every messenger was a prophet.",
      "start": 3567.792,
      "end": 3570.528,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
