        },
        {
          "word": "every",
          "start": 3569.551,
          "end": 3569.746,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "messenger",
          "start": 3569.746,
          "end": 3569.942,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "was",
          "start": 3569.942,
          "end": 3570.137,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "a",
          "start": 3570.137,
          "end": 3570.333,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "prophet.",
          "start": 3570.333,
          "end": 3570.528,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "If the Nabiyeen (\u0646\u0651\u064e\u0628\u0650\u064a\u0651\u0650\u06cc\u0646\u064e) includes the Mursaleen (\u0645\u0631\u0633\u0644\u06cc\u0646), Allah Subhana Wa Ta'ala will not say Rasulullah. He'd say",
      "start": 3570.835,
      "end": 3576.517,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "If",
          "start": 3570.835,
