          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "messengers.",
          "start": 3586.02,
          "end": 3586.358,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But Allah Subhana Wa Ta'ala in the Quran is very accurate, said",
