        },
        {
          "word": "all",
          "start": 3771.718,
          "end": 3772.01,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "the",
          "start": 3772.01,
          "end": 3772.302,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "messages.",
          "start": 3772.302,
          "end": 3772.594,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And God goes, in the Quran, goes through the messengers, one by one, all of them,",
