          "end": 3845.302,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "proof.",
          "start": 3845.302,
          "end": 3845.652,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "God says, in the Quran, we demand proof.",
