        },
        {
          "word": "\u0642\u064f\u0644\u0652",
          "start": 3850.52,
          "end": 3850.836,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "\u0647\u064e\u0627\u062a\u064f\u0648\u0627\u06df",
          "start": 3850.836,
          "end": 3851.152,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "\u0628\u064f\u0631\u0652\u0647\u064e\u0670\u0646\u064e\u0643\u064f\u0645\u0652",
          "start": 3851.152,
          "end": 3851.468,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, a person comes to you and says \"I'm a God's messenger.\"  We say \"what is your proof?\"",
