        },
        {
          "word": "of",
          "start": 4053.397,
          "end": 4053.606,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "Summoning,",
          "start": 4053.606,
          "end": 4053.816,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "(46:6) \u0643\u064e\u0627\u0646\u064f\u0648\u0627\u06df \u0644\u064e\u0647\u064f\u0645\u0652 \u0623\u064e\u0639\u0652\u062f\u064e\u0627\u0653\u0621\u064b\u06ed",
      "start": 4053.816,
      "end": 4055.816,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "(46:6)",
          "start": 4053.816,
          "end": 4054.316,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "\u0643\u064e\u0627\u0646\u064f\u0648\u0627\u06df",
          "start": 4054.316,
          "end": 4054.816,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "\u0644\u064e\u0647\u064f\u0645\u0652",
          "start": 4054.816,
          "end": 4055.316,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "\u0623\u064e\u0639\u0652\u062f\u064e\u0627\u0653\u0621\u064b\u06ed",
          "start": 4055.316,
          "end": 4055.816,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They will become their enemies.",
      "start": 4055.816,
      "end": 4057.386,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "They",
          "start": 4055.816,
          "end": 4056.13,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "will",
          "start": 4056.13,
          "end": 4056.444,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "become",
          "start": 4056.444,
          "end": 4056.758,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "their",
          "start": 4056.758,
          "end": 4057.072,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "enemies.",
          "start": 4057.072,
          "end": 4057.386,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The prophet Muhammad, right now, is dead. As the Quran says,",
      "start": 4057.386,
      "end": 4060.859,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "The",
