          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "description.",
          "start": 4067.652,
          "end": 4067.988,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And on the Day of Judgment, he will be an enemy for people who are calling on him.",
