          "end": 4077.059,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "love.",
          "start": 4077.059,
          "end": 4077.326,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "That if you love Muhammad, you have to commemorate him every day.",
