          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "unaware.",
          "start": 4081.949,
          "end": 4082.493,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And as we see in these verses, they are the farthest, farthest astray.",
