        },
        {
          "word": "that.",
          "start": 4171.177,
          "end": 4171.57,
          "speaker": "A man"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Is Muhammad dead or HAY (\u062d\u064e\u0649\u0651\u0650) (alive)? Is Muhammad MAYYET (\u0645\u064e\u064a\u0651\u0650\u062a\u064c\u06ed) (dead) or HAY (\u062d\u064e\u0649\u0651\u0650) (alive)?",
      "start": 4171.57,
      "end": 4174.184,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "Is",
          "start": 4171.57,
          "end": 4171.733,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
