          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "alive?",
          "start": 4176.925,
          "end": 4177.325,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Muhammad is dead, but Dr. Khalifa: Thank you very much.",
