        },
        {
          "word": "Quran.",
          "start": 4208.628,
          "end": 4208.959,
          "speaker": "A man"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It says, Muhammad is dead.",
      "start": 4208.959,
      "end": 4210.1,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "It",
          "start": 4208.959,
          "end": 4209.187,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "says,",
          "start": 4209.187,
          "end": 4209.415,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "Muhammad",
          "start": 4209.415,
          "end": 4209.644,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "is",
          "start": 4209.644,
          "end": 4209.872,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "dead.",
          "start": 4209.872,
          "end": 4210.1,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, Allah Subhanahu Wa Ta'ala says, don't you believe that those people who died in God's cause, he's dead. They are still alive with God.",
