          "speaker": "A man"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "start": 4221.323,
      "end": 4221.85,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "Yes.",
          "start": 4221.323,
          "end": 4221.85,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And even so I give them food. That means that a human being can be alive with God",
