          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": "everywhere.",
          "start": 4243.173,
          "end": 4243.717,
          "speaker": "A man"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, the Shahid (martyr) is with God.",
      "start": 4243.717,
      "end": 4246.024,
      "speaker": "A man",
      "words": [
