        },
        {
          "word": "God.",
          "start": 4245.694,
          "end": 4246.024,
          "speaker": "A man"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ok. Well, let us, let us show that Muhammad is aware.  A man: Where? Everywhere.",
