        },
        {
          "word": "do?\"",
          "start": 4555.045,
          "end": 4555.231,
          "speaker": "A man"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He said to him \"according to the Quran, I made HASANA (\u062d\u064e\u0633\u064e\u0646\u064e\u0647). So, God will multiply my HASANA (\u062d\u064e\u0633\u064e\u0646\u064e\u0647).\"",
