        },
        {
          "word": "Ok.",
          "start": 4563.611,
          "end": 4563.833,
          "speaker": "A man"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "\"God will multiply my HASANA (\u062d\u064e\u0633\u064e\u0646\u064e\u0647) which I gave to the poor guy. And I made SAYE'A (\u0633\u0651\u064e\u064a\u0651\u0650\u0626\u064e\u0647) bad deed, so God will excuse me for one bad thing and will give me 10 good things.\"",
