    {
      "text": "\"So, I'm winner now. I made 9 out of it.\" The Imam said to him \"what happened is that you stole it, so God writes it for you bad deed, you gave it, God didn't accept it from you. So, you are the loser.\"",
      "start": 4575.651,
      "end": 4590.846,
      "speaker": "A man",
      "words": [
