    {
      "text": "We're not worshipping Muhammad. Dr. Khalifa: Do you agree, do you agree Muhammad is MIN DUNIHI (\u0645\u0650\u0646 \u062f\u064f\u0648\u0646\u0650\u0647\u0650)?",
