        },
        {
          "word": "God.",
          "start": 4685.105,
          "end": 4685.301,
          "speaker": "A man"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He's MIN DUNILLAH (\u0645\u0650\u0646 \u062f\u064f\u0648\u0646\u0650 \u0671\u0644\u0644\u0651\u064e\u0647\u0650).",
