    },
    {
      "text": "Islam is not Millat (\u0645\u0651\u0650\u0644\u0651\u064e\u0629\u064e) Muhammad. It is not. He doesn't know that. It's ignorance of the Quran that causes these disasters.",
      "start": 5390.653,
      "end": 5398.404,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "Islam",
          "start": 5390.653,
          "end": 5391.005,
