          "word": "\u0633\u064e\u0645\u0651\u064e\u0649\u0670\u0643\u064f\u0645\u064f",
          "start": 5450.534,
          "end": 5450.919,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "\u0671\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u0633\u0652\u0644\u0650\u0645\u0650\u064a\u0646\u064e",
          "start": 5450.919,
          "end": 5451.303,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "\u0645\u0650\u0646",
          "start": 5451.303,
          "end": 5451.688,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "\u0642\u064e\u0628\u0652\u0644\u064f",
          "start": 5451.688,
          "end": 5452.072,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "This fellow here insulted Muhammad and he does not realize that before Muhammad there was life.",
      "start": 5452.44,
      "end": 5457.202,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "This",
          "start": 5452.44,
          "end": 5452.738,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "fellow",
          "start": 5452.738,
          "end": 5453.035,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "here",
          "start": 5453.035,
          "end": 5453.333,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "insulted",
          "start": 5453.333,
          "end": 5453.631,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "Muhammad",
          "start": 5453.631,
          "end": 5453.928,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "and",
          "start": 5453.928,
          "end": 5454.226,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "he",
          "start": 5454.226,
          "end": 5454.523,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "does",
          "start": 5454.523,
          "end": 5454.821,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "not",
          "start": 5454.821,
          "end": 5455.119,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "realize",
          "start": 5455.119,
          "end": 5455.416,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "that",
          "start": 5455.416,
          "end": 5455.714,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "before",
          "start": 5455.714,
          "end": 5456.012,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "Muhammad",
          "start": 5456.012,
          "end": 5456.309,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "there",
          "start": 5456.309,
          "end": 5456.607,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "was",
          "start": 5456.607,
          "end": 5456.904,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "life.",
          "start": 5456.904,
          "end": 5457.202,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He does not realize. He think life started with Muhammad. A man: He didn't answer my question.",
      "start": 5457.877,
      "end": 5461.227,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "He",
          "start": 5457.877,
          "end": 5458.074,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "does",
          "start": 5458.074,
          "end": 5458.271,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "not",
          "start": 5458.271,
          "end": 5458.468,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "realize.",
          "start": 5458.468,
          "end": 5458.665,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "He",
